blems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 18 (page does not exist)\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"CEMC Cayley\">CEMC Cayley</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018031817\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 265/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5250/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 728/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0